cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these records, please cite the archived release of this digital annex."
type: dataset
title: "Digital Annex: Master Thesis on Transformation-Enabling Conditions"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Reinecke
    given-names: Thomas
    affiliation: IU International University of Applied Sciences
abstract: >-
  Digital annex of the master thesis "Enterprise Transformation Readiness: A Design
  Science Study of Transformation-Enabling Conditions Operationalised in an AI-Supported
  Governance Application" (M.Sc. Artificial Intelligence, 2026). It holds the records
  that are too large to print: the screening record of the systematic literature review,
  the Condition Findings with the source locators of their audited evidence and the
  contributing publications, and the classification record of all condition aspects.
keywords:
  - transformation readiness
  - digital transformation
  - enterprise architecture
  - IT governance
  - design science research
  - operationalisation
  - AI-based automation
